nimate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I was hoping for a starting level one-shot, basically to introduce people to the game. Only 1 major fight.</div> </div> </div> </div>What's the theme of the one shot? Also what would they be fighting? Like I have a couple but one is a pretty hardcore dedicated sailor and stuff. I've got a bit of time it might just be easier to drop a few here that fit your idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-02T02:20:22-08:00","id":1430734,"title":"","content":"Where are the Dragon-Blooded from and do you want min-maxed PCs or more characters which work well within the game setting?<br /> <br /> 'Cause, I've got a few I can link.<br /> <br /> ****<br /> <br /> Standard Dragon-Blooded<br /> <br /> These characters are built to the standard assumptions of the game. They can fight fifty burly men at once. They can pick locks... in the dark.. without lockpicks. They can remove a burst appendix without killing the patient. And then there's the stuff they're actually good at!<br /> <br /> These are Dragon-Blooded. They don't fight against Celestial Exalted (or Directional War Gods) one-on-one. Back them up with a mortal army and three or four of their kin, and they <i>can</i> fight such beings, but it's a risky proposition. They fight First Circle Demons. They fight the strange creatures that crawl out of the Wyld. Truculant Storm Mothers. Dread beasts like the Manticore (which drives folks to commit cannibalism to avoid fighting one).<br /> <br /> Cynis Lokaret - Monster Hunter<br /> <br /> This is what a combat focused, non-optimized character looks like. They can solo fight Tyrant Lizards, but they can also, you know, <i>read.</i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Cynis Lokaret<br /> Wood Aspect<br /> Monster Hunter<br /> House of Bells<br /> <br /> Dynasts love hunting dangerous game, but occasionally things get out-of-hand: then professional monster hunters are called in to clean up. Lok is one such hunter.<br /> <br /> Strength 3 (8BP)<br /> Dexterity 5<br /> Stamina 5<br /> <br /> <br /> Charisma 2<br /> Manipulation 3<br /> Appearance 2<br /> <br /> <br /> Perception 2<br /> Intelligence 1<br /> Wits 5<br /> <br /> <br /> Wood Aspect Abilities (and Specialties)<br /> Archery 2 (Big Game)<br /> Medicine 0<br /> Performance 1<br /> Ride 2<br /> Survival 2<br /> <br /> <br /> Favored Abilities (10 BP)<br /> Athletics 1<br /> Awareness 2 (Join Battle)<br /> Dodge 2 (Larger Foes)<br /> Integrity 1<br /> Melee 5 (Two-handed Weapons)<br /> <br /> <br /> Other Abilities<br /> Brawl 2<br /> Linguistics 1<br /> Lore 2<br /> Occult 3<br /> Presence 3<br /> Resistance 2<br /> Socialize 2<br /> War 3<br /> <br /> <br /> Merits (Native Language: High Realm)<br /> Artifact 3 (Grand Daiklave)<br /> Artifact 3 (Reinforced Breastplate)<br /> Manse 3 (Iron Soul Stone)<br /> Influence 1 (Renowned Hunter)<br /> (Dynastic Freebie) Resources 3<br /> (Dynastic Freebie) Language (Riverspeak)<br /> (Dynastic Freebie) Language (Low Realm)<br /> <br /> <br /> Free Excellencies<br /> 1. Archery: Unobstructed Hunter\u2019s Aim<br /> 2. Awareness: Precision Awareness Method<br /> 3. Dodge: Threshold Warding Stance<br /> 4. Melee: Stoking Bonfire Style<br /> 5. Survival: Ration-Enhancing Technique<br /> <br /> <br /> Charms<br /> <br /> <br /> 1. Melee: <span style=\"font-family:serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Burning Fury Wreath</span></span><br /> 2. Melee: Crimson Fang Bite<br /> 3. Melee: <span style=\"font-family:serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Demon-Crushing Wolf Bite</span></span><br /> 4. Melee: <span style=\"font-family:serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Blinding Spark Distraction</span></span><br /> 5. Melee: <span style=\"font-family:serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Crossfire Flash</span></span><br /> 6. Occult: Soul-Fire Cremation Technique<br /> 7. Occult: Seed and Salt Warding<br /> 8. Occult: Spirit Detecting Mirror<br /> 9. Occult: Spirit Grounding Shout<br /> 10. Occult: Invulnerable Skin of Bronze<br /> 11. Resistance: Ox-Body Technique<br /> 12. Resistance: Ox-Body Technique x2<br /> 13. Resistance: Purifying Blood Ascendancy<br /> 14. Resistance: Impervious Skin of Stone<br /> 15. Survival: Quarry Revelation Technique<br /> <br /> Intimacies<br /> Defining Principle: I live for the thrill of the hunt! I fear no beast!<br /> Major Principle: The Immaculate Philosophy<br /> Minor Tie: My sword (Proud Possessiveness)<br /> Minor Tie: House Cynis (Naked Contempt)<br /> <br /> <br /> Combat<br /> Evasion 2 (2m: +1 and ignore environmental penalties)<br /> Parry 6<br /> <br /> Soak 7 Hardness 0<br /> (+Invulnerable Skin of Bronze: Soak 13 Hardness 8)<br /> (+Breastplate: Soak 22 Hardness 10)<br /> Mobility Penalty -2<br /> Resist Poison: 7 dice (2m: +1 success, reroll 6s)<br /> <br /> <br /> Grand Daiklave: Accuracy 12 (11 Decisive)(6m: +6); Damage 17 (6 OVR)(4m 1i: +5 OVR); Lethal, Melee, Reaching, Two-Handed<br /> Exceptional Long Bow: Accuracy 6/12/10/8/- (8 Decisive)(3m: +3); Damage 12 (1 OVR); Lethal, Archery (Long)<br /> <br /> Rush: 4<br /> Disengage: 5 (6 vs larger foes)(2m: +1 success and ignore environmental penalties)<br /> <br /> Join Battle: 8 dice (3m: +3 dice)<br /> <br /> Social<br /> Manipulative Presence 6 dice<br /> <br /> Resolve 3<br /> Guile 3<br /> <br /> Willpower 5<br /> Essence 2<br /> <br /> Personal motes 13<br /> Peripheral motes 31 (20, 11 committed)<br /> <br /> Health Track<br /> -0 x1<br /> -1 x4<br /> -2 x6<br /> -4 x1<br /> Incap</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Cynis Jinabar - A Magistrate<br /> <br /> An actual PC from <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1341506-dynasty-of-dovak-campaign-notes-and-play-report\">my Dragon-Blooded game</a>. On first meeting someone, you use Auspicious First Meeting Attitude. Then between Dragon Mariner Attitude and Impeccable Purity Lavation, you should have three minor intimacies to key your social influence off of.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <b>Cynis Jinabar \u2013 A Magistrate</b><br /> <br /> Cynis Falen Jinabar<br /> Fire Aspect<br /> Spiral Academy<br /> Ambitious Magistrate<br /> <br /> <b>Attributes</b><br /> <br /> Strength 2<br /> Dexterity 3<br /> Stamina 2<br /> <br /> Charisma 2<br /> Manipulation 5<br /> Appearance 4<br /> <br /> Perception 3<br /> Intelligence 2<br /> Wits 3<br /> <br /> <b>Fire Aspect Abilities (and Specialties)</b> (3BP)<br /> <br /> Athletics 2<br /> Dodge 1 (capote de brega)<br /> Melee 4 (Staves)<br /> Presence 3 (On \u201cOfficial\u201d Business)<br /> Socialize 3<br /> <br /> <b>Favored Abilities</b> (15BP)<br /> <br /> Awareness 1<br /> Integrity 4<br /> Investigation 3<br /> Larceny 5<br /> Resistance 2 (Intoxicants)<br /> <br /> <b>Other Abilities</b><br /> <br /> Archery 3<br /> Brawl 1<br /> Bureaucracy 3 (Corruption)<br /> Linguistics 2<br /> Lore 3<br /> Performance 3<br /> Ride 2<br /> Sail 2<br /> <br /> <b>Merits (Native Language: High Realm)</b><br /> <br /> Artifact 3 (Calumny)<br /> Backing (The Magistracy) 3<br /> Direction Sense 1<br /> Eidetic Memory 2<br /> Retainers 2 (Mott, the Archivist)<br /> Well Bred 2<br /> (Dynastic Freebie) Language (Low Realm)<br /> (Dynastic Freebie) Language (Riverspeak)<br /> (Dynastic Freebie) Language (Old Realm)<br /> (Dynastic Freebie) Language (Firetongue)<br /> (Dynastic Freebie) Followers 1 (12 Archons)<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Charms</b><br /> <br /> 1. Bureaucracy: Geese-Flying-South Administration<br /> 2. Bureaucracy: Finding the Water\u2019s Depths<br /> 3. Bureaucracy: Confluence of Savant Thought<br /> 4. Bureaucracy: Water-Stained Ledger<br /> E1. Integrity: Granite Curtain of Serenity<br /> E2. Investigation: Indisputable Physical Analysis Technique<br /> E3. Larceny: Underground River\u2019s Flow<br /> 5. Larceny: Resetting Tumblers Technique<br /> 6. Larceny: Naked Thief Style<br /> E4. Melee: Stoking Bonfire Style<br /> E5. Presence: Glowing Coal Radiance<br /> 7. Resistance: Purifying Blood Ascendancy<br /> 8. Resistance: Ox-Body Technique<br /> 9. Sail: Dragon Mariner Attitude<br /> 10. Socialize: Loquacious Courtier Technique<br /> 11. Socialize: Friend-to-All-Nations Attitude<br /> 12. Socialize: Loyalty-Reading Meditation<br /> 13. Socialize: Auspicious First Meeting Attitude<br /> 14. Socialize: Impeccable Purity Lavation<br /> <br /> <b>Evocations</b><br /> <br /> Free: Calumny: Rustling Grapevine Whispers<br /> 15. Calumny: Unassuming Ornament Camouflage<br /> <br /> <b>Intimacies</b><br /> <br /> Defining Principle: The Dragon-Blooded are born to rule.<br /> Minor Principle: The Immaculate Philosophy (Devout Belief)<br /> Minor Principle: Pleasure before duty<br /> Major Tie: House Cynis (Familial duty)<br /> Major Tie: Mott and my Archons (Family)<br /> Minor Tie: Anathema (Loathing)<br /> Minor Tie: The Scarlet Empress (Infatuation)<br /> <br /> <b>Combat</b><br /> <br /> Evasion 3<br /> Parry 5 (+2, 6m)<br /> <br /> Soak 5 (Exceptional breastplate) Hardness 0<br /> Mobility Penalty -0<br /> <br /> Resist Poison/Disease: 4 dice (+2, 2m)<br /> <br /> Calumny: Accuracy 11 (8 Decisive)(+6, 6m); Damage 14 (4 OVR); Melee, Bashing, Concealable, Reaching<br /> <br /> Exceptional Composite Bow<br /> <br /> Rush: 4<br /> Disengage: 4<br /> <br /> Join Battle: 4 dice<br /> <br /> <b>Social</b><br /> <br /> Manipulative Presence: 9 dice (+2 successes, 10s explode, 4m)<br /> <br /> Resolve 5 (+2, ignore -1 from wounds, deprivation or poison, 4m)<br /> Guile 4 (+2, 4m mute)<br /> <br /> Willpower 5<br /> Essence 2<br /> <br /> Personal motes 13<br /> Peripheral motes 31 (21, 10 committed)<br /> <br /> Health Track<br /> -0 x1 [ ]<br /> -1 x2 [ ] [ ]<br /> -2 x4 [ ] [ ] [ ] [ ]<br /> -4 x1 [ ]<br /> Incap</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> ****<br /> <br /> Min-maxed Dragon-Blooded<br /> <br /> Psst, hey kid, wanna break the game?<br /> <br /> These characters are tooled to the hilt. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1305398-exalted-arena?p=1366712#post1366712\">Here's one of them solo-ing a Dawn Caste Solar</a>.<br /> <br /> Ragara, Smash<br /> <br /> One of my earlier DB builds. It does use a five-dot artifact so whether or it it's kosher is going to be a ST call. Get to Earth Dragon Form, make Smash attacks backed by Force of the Mountain and a 3m Excellency. Ideally, delay to Clash. There are better builds, but not many better builds:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ragara Smash<br /> Earth Aspect<br /> Righteous Warrior<br /> Heptagram<br /> <br /> Strength 5<br /> Dexterity 5<br /> Stamina 1<br /> <br /> Charisma 1<br /> Manipulation 5<br /> Appearance 1<br /> <br /> Perception 1<br /> Intelligence 3<br /> Wits 5<br /> <br /> Earth Aspect Abilities (and Specialities) (4 BP)<br /> <br /> Awareness 5 (Join Battle)<br /> Craft: Weapons 1 (Javelins)<br /> Integrity 5<br /> Resistance 3<br /> War 1<br /> <br /> Favored Abilities (8 BP)<br /> <br /> Athletics 5 (Rushes)<br /> Brawl 1<br /> Earth Dragon Style 5 (Armed)<br /> Lore: Heptagram education 5 (The Shogunate)<br /> Occult 5<br /> Melee 3<br /> <br /> Other Abilities<br /> <br /> Linguistics 1<br /> <br /> Merits (Native Language: High Realm) (6BP)<br /> <br /> Artifact 3 (Fist of Titans)<br /> Artifact 5 (Mela's Coil - Or any 5 Dot Heavy Armor that doesn't have a mobility penalty)<br /> Martial Artist 4<br /> Pain Tolerance 4<br /> (3 BP) Manse 3 (Stone of the Ram's Horn)<br /> (Dynastic Freebie) Resources 3<br /> (Dynastic Freebie) Language (Riverspeak)<br /> (Dynastic Freebie) Language (Old Realm)<br /> <br /> Free Excellencies<br /> <br /> 1. Athletics: Effortlessly Rising Flame<br /> 2. Awareness: Precision Awareness Method<br /> 3. Brawl/Martial Arts: Become the Hammer<br /> 4. Integrity: Granite Curtain of Serenity<br /> 5. Resistance: Purifying Blood Ascendancy<br /> <br /> Charms<br /> <br /> 1. Melee: Elemental Sheath<br /> 2. Melee: Dragon Graced Weapon<br /> 3. Earth Dragon Style: Stone Dragon Skin<br /> 4. Earth Dragon Style: Force of the Mountain<br /> 5. Earth Dragon Style: Stillness of Stone Artemi<br /> 6. Earth Dragon Style: Unmoving Mountain Stance<br /> 7. Earth Dragon Style: Earth Dragon Form<br /> 8. Occult: Spirit Detecting Mirror<br /> 9