tal and undead minions of the Abyssal\u2014so gamebreaking combat monsters, while cool, should be avoided.<br /> <br /> I also was considering giving the players 1-2 signature abilities or Essence 3 evocations, since they are where the appeal of playing Dragonblooded shines the most (in my opinion).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23919-nabirius","name":"Nabirius","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23919_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"75"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}